    <item>
      <title>Tracking Over 35,000 Fake Sites in the 2026 World Cup Scam Wave</title>
      <description>Between January and June 2026, TrendAI™ tracked more than 35,000 fake sites exploiting the 2026 FIFA World Cup, spanning counterfeit merchandise shops, cloned ticket pages, and bogus free-streaming sites, which together drew roughly 1.48 million visits from Japan.</description>
